 "assessment": {
  "name": "NovoPsych Five Factor Personality Scale – 30 item version (NFFPS-30)",
  "short_name": null,
  "language": "en",
  "description": "The NovoPsych Five Factor Personality Scale – 30 is a brief self-report personality inventory measuring the well established five factor model of personality (a.k.a OCEAN). It is for use by older adolescents (ages 16+) and adults, where personality characteristics are compared to age and gender norms on the five factors of Openness, Conscientiousness, Extraversion, Agreeableness and Neuroticism.",
